flowchart TD
    A[🏠 Start: Dashboard] --> B[👥 Open 'Customers' Tab]
    B --> C[🔍 Search Customer Name]
    C --> D[📖 Open Customer Ledger]
    
    D --> E{Action}
    E -->|Record Payment| F[➕ Click 'Add Transaction']
    E -->|Send Reminder| K
    
    F --> G{Select Type}
    G -->|Credit (Received)| H[💰 Enter Amount Received]
    G -->|Debit (Given Credit)| I[📝 Enter Amount & Description]
    
    H --> J[🧠 AI Auto-Categorizes<br>e.g., 'Rent' -> 'Expense']
    I --> J
    
    J --> L[💾 Save Transaction]
    L --> M[🔄 Balance Updates Instantly]
    M --> N{Check Outstanding Balance}
    
    N -->|Overdue / Pending| O[🔔 Click 'Send Reminder']
    N -->|Cleared| P[✅ End of Flow]
    
    O --> Q{Choose Channel}
    Q -->|WhatsApp| R[📲 Template Message with Balance]
    Q -->|SMS| S[✉️ Text Message with Balance]
    
    R --> T[📱 Customer Receives Reminder]
    S --> T
    T --> P
    
    style M fill:#fff59d,stroke:#f57f17
    style T fill:#ef9a9a,stroke:#c62828